      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/New_Lisbon%2C_New_York",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Gilbert Lake State Park sits on New Lisbon’s southern town line and features a lake that was enlarged for industry.",
